# SokoYetu Stage 30D: Public Help Center and Customer Service Hub

Stage 30D adds a public customer help center.

## New page

```text
/help-center.html
```

## Purpose

The help center gives customers one clear place to access:

```text
/track-order.html
/support-request.html
/returns-policy.html
/contact-support.html
/faq.html
/seller-policy.html
/privacy-policy.html
/terms-of-service.html
/data-protection.html
/checkout.html
```

## Sitemap

`sitemap.xml` is updated to include:

```text
https://www.mysokoyetu.co.ke/help-center.html
```

## What this stage does not touch

```text
checkout logic
M-PESA STK Push
DNS
email forwarding
admin tokens
database schema
product import
seller verification logic
support queue logic
LiveKit
```

## Test

```cmd
npm run stage30d:check
npm run dev
```

Open:

```text
http://localhost:5173/help-center.html
```
